---
const stats = [
  { value: '<1s', label: 'Tiempo de carga objetivo' },
  { value: '95+', label: 'Puntuación Lighthouse' },
  { value: '100%', label: 'Adaptada a móvil' },
  { value: '24h', label: 'Respuesta a tu solicitud' },
];
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Fondo: cuadrícula + resplandor -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff08_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff08_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:56px_56px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,black_30%,transparent_75%)]"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[500px] w-[800px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 blur-[120px]"></div>

  <div class="container-lb relative pt-20 pb-24 text-center sm:pt-28">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-400/30 bg-brand-400/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-brand-200">
      <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2"><span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-brand-400 opacity-75"></span><span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-400"></span></span>
      Aceptando nuevos proyectos
    </span>

    <h1 class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.1] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
      Webs que <span class="text-gradient">rugen</span>.<br /> Clientes que llegan.
    </h1>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-zinc-400 sm:text-xl">
      En LionByte diseñamos y desarrollamos webs rápidas, modernas y pensadas para convertir visitas en clientes. Tecnología actual, trato cercano y resultados medibles.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a href="#contacto" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">
        Quiero mi web
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#servicios" class="btn-ghost w-full sm:w-auto">Ver servicios</a>
    </div>

    <dl class="mx-auto mt-20 grid max-w-4xl grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-4">
      {stats.map((s) => (
        <div class="card !p-5">
          <dt class="sr-only">{s.label}</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white">{s.value}</dd>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-400">{s.label}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
